text: <|channel|>analysis<|message|>We need to write a Python function that merges two sorted lists into one sorted list without using sort(). So basically implement merge step of merge sort. The function should take two sorted lists and return a merged sorted list. We can use two pointers. The function signature: def merge_sorted_lists(a, b):
